@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@customerId = 1

### Put 2 units of product 1 in the cart (product must be ACTIVE; seed products mostly are)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cart/items/1
X-Customer-Id: {{customerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 2 }

### Same request again: still 2, not 4
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cart/items/1
X-Customer-Id: {{customerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 2 }

### View cart
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cart
X-Customer-Id: {{customerId}}

### Remove
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cart/items/1
X-Customer-Id: {{customerId}}